chart heatmap
title "진행 그래프: 두 스레드의 cnt++ 실행 궤적"
subtitle "열은 스레드 1의 명령, 행은 스레드 2의 명령. 1인 칸은 둘 다 임계 영역(L, U, S)에 있는 불안전 영역이다"

cell "H2" "H1" 0
cell "H2" "L1" 0
cell "H2" "U1" 0
cell "H2" "S1" 0
cell "H2" "T1" 0
cell "L2" "H1" 0
cell "L2" "L1" 1
cell "L2" "U1" 1
cell "L2" "S1" 1
cell "L2" "T1" 0
cell "U2" "H1" 0
cell "U2" "L1" 1
cell "U2" "U1" 1
cell "U2" "S1" 1
cell "U2" "T1" 0
cell "S2" "H1" 0
cell "S2" "L1" 1
cell "S2" "U1" 1
cell "S2" "S1" 1
cell "S2" "T1" 0
cell "T2" "H1" 0
cell "T2" "L1" 0
cell "T2" "U1" 0
cell "T2" "S1" 0
cell "T2" "T1" 0

step "안전한 궤적" "스레드 1이 끝난 뒤 스레드 2가 실행하면 불안전 영역을 피한다"
  light "H2" "H1"
  light "H2" "L1"
  light "H2" "U1"
  light "H2" "S1"
  light "H2" "T1"
  light "L2" "T1"
  light "U2" "T1"
  light "S2" "T1"
  light "T2" "T1"
step "불안전한 궤적" "두 스레드가 임계 영역에서 번갈아 실행하면 불안전 영역을 지난다"
  light "H2" "H1"
  light "H2" "L1"
  light "L2" "L1"
  light "L2" "U1"
  light "U2" "U1"
  light "U2" "S1"
  light "S2" "S1"
  light "S2" "T1"
  light "T2" "T1"
